    42	
    43	`expect_date(self._day)` runs before all under-lock Git subprocesses at [records_txn.py:394–399](/tmp/claude-1007/-home-yixunhu-codespace-FLAC/1630c6fe-5d3e-42b4-94ec-1b6d3bcb0e4e/scratchpad/r3a/records_txn/records_txn.py:394). Multiple commands, each with a 120-second timeout, can cross midnight before `_install()` creates the mark.
    44	
    45	Fix: move the date recheck after the Git loop, immediately before `_install()`, and add a call-order test in which the Git check advances the mocked clock.
