    49	After successful debris cleanup, the active marker is unlinked at [records_txn.py:473–479](/tmp/claude-1007/-home-yixunhu-codespace-FLAC/1630c6fe-5d3e-42b4-94ec-1b6d3bcb0e4e/scratchpad/r3a/records_txn/records_txn.py:473), but the state directory is not fsynced. A crash can resurrect a stale marker. This is conservative rather than corrupting, but it falls short of the otherwise explicit durable lifecycle.
