- [docs_1105k_int.py:14](/tmp/claude-1007/-home-yixunhu-codespace-FLAC/1630c6fe-5d3e-42b4-94ec-1b6d3bcb0e4e/scratchpad/r3a/docs_1105k_int.py:14) omits the scratch-test evidence and INT-L2 launch transcript.
